    "title": "Roth IRA vs. Traditional IRA: How to Choose the Right Account",
    "question": "Should I choose a Roth IRA or a traditional IRA, and how do I know which is better for my situation?",
    "summary": "Roth and Traditional IRAs both offer tax advantages for retirement savings, but differ in when taxes are applied, income eligibility, and withdrawal rules. The best choice depends on your current vs. expected future tax rate, income level, age, and financial flexibility needs.",
